Name:           vkq3ng
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        @RELEASE@
Summary:        Vulkan Quake III Arena engine with native Wayland and RTX
License:        GPL-2.0-or-later
URL:            https://github.com/kubuntugamer/vkq3ng
BuildArch:      @ARCH@
AutoReqProv:    yes

%description
A Linux-focused continuation of vkq3ng, the Vulkan and ray-tracing fork
of Quake III Arena.  It provides native Wayland windowing, PipeWire
audio, cross-vendor KHR ray tracing, DLSS, FSR2, EASU, and NVIDIA Reflex.

This package contains the engine binaries and the CC0 blue-noise
textures required by the RTX renderer.  Quake III Arena data files and
third-party texture packs are not included.

%install
rm -rf %{buildroot}
cp -a @STAGE_ROOT@/. %{buildroot}/

%files
%defattr(-,root,root,-)
/usr/bin/vkq3ng
/usr/lib/vkq3ng
/usr/share/vkq3ng
/usr/share/doc/vkq3ng

%changelog
* Sun Nov 22 2026 kubuntugamer <kubuntugamer@users.noreply.github.com> - @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
- Initial packaged release.
